    "text": "By Hannah Hall Arianna Bertolotti ,\n12 hours ago WILMINGTON, N.C. (WECT) - The high-profile Tru Colors murder trial is continuing its second week as jury selection hit multiple snags on Wednesday. Lawyers are working to seat 12 jurors and three alternates in the cases of Omonte Bell and Dyrell Green. Both men are charged in the deaths of Bri-Yanna Williams and Koredreese Tyson that happened at the home of a former Tru Colors Brewing executive. Five jurors were already seated on Monday, May 18. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
